  <section class="container py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Hello, I'm Azoth.</h1><div class="prose mt-10"><p>I'm a developer who stays curious about the space where design and engineering meet. I enjoy breaking complex problems into digital experiences that feel clear, reliable, and delightful.</p><h2>This website</h2><p>This is a long-lived digital garden: home to polished technical essays, ideas still taking shape, and experiments made for the browser. The website itself is part of the experiment.</p><h2>Current interests</h2><ul><li>Modern web engineering and performance</li><li>Design systems and interaction details</li><li>Creative coding, Canvas, and WebGL</li><li>Open-source tools and knowledge management</li></ul></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
